/","children":["Fully funded scholarships for international students"," ",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]]}]]}]
23:["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Is the quoted amount before or after tuition?",{"children":"Is the quoted amount before or after tuition?"}],["$","li","How many years are guaranteed?",{"children":"How many years are guaranteed?"}],["$","li","Are teaching or research hours included?",{"children":"Are teaching or research hours included?"}],["$","li","Does funding continue during fieldwork or leave?",{"children":"Does funding continue during fieldwork or leave?"}],["$","li","Which health-insurance and student fees remain?",{"children":"Which health-insurance and student fees remain?"}],["$","li","Is a supervisor commitment required before admission?",{"children":"Is a supervisor commitment required before admission?"}]]}]
24:["$","section","4-Pearson 2027: nominate, apply, then complete the award",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Pearson 2027: nominate, apply, then complete the award"}],[["$","p","For September 2027 entry, the University of Toronto's published schedule is 9 October 2026 for a school's nomination, 16 October for undergraduate admission and 6 November for the scholarship application. These dates are three distinct actions; the university issues the private scholarship form after school nomination.",{"children":"For September 2027 entry, the University of Toronto's published schedule is 9 October 2026 for a school's nomination, 16 October for undergraduate admission and 6 November for the scholarship application. These dates are three distinct actions; the university issues the private scholarship form after school nomination."}],["$","p","The award describes tuition, books, incidental fees and full residence support for four years. Confirm programme admission conditions and plan for any expenses not included in this published benefit list. Our dedicated Pearson guide breaks down the complete nomination sequence.",{"children":"The award describes tuition, books, incidental fees and full residence support for four years. Confirm programme admission conditions and plan for any expenses not included in this published benefit list. Our dedicated Pearson guide breaks down the complete nomination sequence."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
25:["$","section","5-Graduate funding: request a written breakdown",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Graduate funding: request a written breakdown"}],[["$","p","Ask the programme or department whether the headline amount comes from a guaranteed stipend, a teaching assistantship, a supervisor's project or a competitive award. Confirm the term covered and what remains after tuition and compulsory charges.",{"children":"Ask the programme or department whether the headline amount comes from a guaranteed stipend, a teaching assistantship, a supervisor's project or a competitive award. Confirm the term covered and what remains after tuition and compulsory charges."}],["$","p","Estimate living expenses for the actual city, then ask whether a research supervisor must agree to support the application before admission. Undergraduate nomination advice does not transfer to this route.",{"children":"Estimate living expenses for the actual city, then ask whether a research supervisor must agree to support the application before admission. Undergraduate nomination advice does not transfer to this route."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
26:["$","section","6-Pearson's remaining dates are not a new nomination window",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Pearson's remaining dates are not a new nomination window"}],[["$","p","For the named September 2027 Pearson cycle, school nomination ended on 9 October 2026. The remaining 16 October admission and 6 November scholarship tasks apply to already nominated students. If you missed nomination, compare other undergraduate routes instead of treating the later date as a fresh application opening.",{"children":"For the named September 2027 Pearson cycle, school nomination ended on 9 October 2026. The remaining 16 October admission and 6 November scholarship tasks apply to already nominated students. If you missed nomination, compare other undergraduate routes instead of treating the later date as a fresh application opening."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Pearson's remaining dates are not a new nomination window","children":[["$","$L4","/scholarships/lester-b-pearson/",{"href":"/scholarships/lester-b-pearson/","children":["Read the complete Pearson sequence",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/scholarships/bachelors/",{"href":"/scholarships/bachelors/","children":["Compare undergraduate awards",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$6:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
